# Marketing Campaign ROI Analysis

This project demonstrates how to extract and transform marketing data using SQL and Python (Pandas), aligned with digital marketing analytics workflows. It covers:

- SQL-based data extraction from Google Analytics, ad platforms, and CRM
- Data cleaning and transformation using Pandas
- ROI and CTR calculation for campaign performance
- Business-ready logic for stakeholder reporting

No visualization libraries are used — the focus is on backend analytics and business impact.

## Technologies Used
- Python 3.10+
- Pandas
- SQLAlchemy
- PostgreSQL / MySQL (configurable)

